  "interpretation": "The framework is an impact-effect calculator: it models the first-year mechanical income loss from displacement with the poverty line frozen, no benefit uprating, no unemployment-duration dynamics and no behavioural response. History over 2008-10 combined a similar-sized employment shock with inflation-uprated benefits and a falling median, so measured poverty and inequality did not rise. The gap between the simulated and observed changes quantifies what those absorbing channels delivered."
